---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-12 bg-forest-800 text-forest-100">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-6 px-4 py-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-8">
    <div>
      <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-white">⛰️ Kolli Hills</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-forest-200">
        A visitor's guide to the "Mountain of Death" — the lush, misty hill range
        of Namakkal district, Tamil Nadu, famous for its 70 hairpin bends,
        waterfalls and medicinal herbs.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-forest-300">Explore</h4>
      <ul class="mt-2.5 space-y-1.5 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/attractions" class="hover:text-white">Attractions</a></li>
        <li><a href="/stay" class="hover:text-white">Places to Stay</a></li>
        <li><a href="/eat" class="hover:text-white">Where to Eat</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-white">Plan Your Trip</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-forest-300">Stay Safe</h4>
      <ul class="mt-2.5 space-y-1.5 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/advisories" class="hover:text-white">Travel Advisories</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contacts" class="hover:text-white">Emergency Contacts</a></li>
        <li><a href="/facilities" class="hover:text-white">Facilities &amp; Amenities</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-forest-300">Quick Help</h4>
      <ul class="mt-2.5 space-y-1.5 text-sm">
        <li>Police: <a href="tel:100" class="font-semibold text-white">100</a></li>
        <li>Ambulance: <a href="tel:108" class="font-semibold text-white">108</a></li>
        <li>Fire: <a href="tel:101" class="font-semibold text-white">101</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-forest-700 px-4 py-4 text-center text-xs text-forest-300">
    <p>© {year} Kolli Hills Visitor Guide · Community-maintained information. Verify timings &amp; status before you travel.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
